{"version":1,"content":"<p>女星Angelababy（楊穎）篤信佛家，早前被網民拍到現身浙江省的普陀山祈福，她穿上運動裝，笠帽又戴口罩，雖然打扮低調，但依然被善信發現。</p><p>而最惹人關注的，是她身旁多了一位滿面鬍鬚、日系打扮的健碩男士，有指這鬍鬚男其實是比她年輕7歲的弟弟楊</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T16:20:28.906765+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T16:01:16+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T16:13:37.254673+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T16:13:37.254673+00:00","content_hash":"8c32faae405f4ac0da388fffeb0b6d2a57f8c0f0816c01ea0e4d6d98245b7e2f","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}